# Playwright MCP screenshot artefacts
.playwright-mcp/
*.png
# ...but visual-regression baselines are SOURCE, not artefacts. Without
# them committed the suite has nothing to compare against and silently
# re-records on every machine, which is the same as not having it.
!dashboard/packages/client/e2e/**/*-snapshots/*.png


